DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaiicc driver provides support for the Adaptec AIC-6260 and AIC-6360
     SCSI controller chips.

     The ISA attachment of the aaiicc driver supports the Adaptec 152x, the
     Creative Labs SoundBlaster SCSI host adapter, and compatibles.  Many ISA
     cards that use this chip do not have boot ROMs, and therefore cannot be
     used to connect the boot device.

     The ISA Plug-and-Play attachment of the aaiicc driver supports the Adaptec
     AHA-1520B host adapter.

     The PCMCIA attachment of the aaiicc driver supports the Adaptec APA-14[56]0.
     These SCSI host adapters do not include boot ROMs and therefore cannot be
     used to connect the boot device.

